===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|dissh}}, {{m|enm|disch}}, from {{inh|en|ang|disċ|t=plate; bowl; dish}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*disk|t=table; dish}}, from {{der|en|la|discus}}.  {{doublet|en|dais|desk|disc|discus|disk|diskos}}.

